// Sand trickles into the mole's body (the CA doesn't know the mole is there). In a low tunnel there's
// no room to wriggle up, and walking only shoves powder in the leading column, so a grain behind the
// leading edge used to wedge the mole for good. Stray grains inside the body are shoved aside now.
map
################
#..............#
#..............#
#....s@........#
################
end
hold 1-60 right
expect 60 dx >= 5
expect 60 count:Sand == 1      // pushed aside, not lost
